cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Explain-to-Learn"
abstract: >-
  Level-matched explanations and hints for grammar corrections in English learners'
  writing, grounded in a teacher-built grammar graph, with the data pipeline, LoRA
  training, automatic metrics and human evaluation used to compare grounded and
  ungrounded systems.
authors:
  - family-names: Mirzaei
    given-names: Mohsen
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/m-555/explain-to-learn"
keywords:
  - grammatical error explanation
  - grammatical error correction
  - language learning
  - CEFR
  - educational NLP
  - LoRA
